- Status arithmetic ported verbatim: isActive (mode==maintenance), untilTs (Date.parse),
  minutesToStart (floor((until-now)/60000)), within24h (active && 0 < until-now <= 24h).
- handleSchedule: durMin = max(5, Number(duration) || 60); end = start + dur;
  default message "Scheduled maintenance . ends {dt}"; until = ISO(end). Validation
  branches: "Pick a start time." / "Invalid start time.".
- handleClear: {mode:ok,message:'',until:null}.
- Toasts (useToast): scheduled / cleared / pick-start / invalid-start / "Failed to schedule"
  / "Failed to clear maintenance" (server message preferred, web err.message).
- Variant ring: amber within 24h, blue active (web ring-amber-400/40 / ring-blue-400/30).
